{# adhd-mode turn-shape: per-turn-type shape spec for composing ADHD-shaped output. Generic over the active process skill's content obligations (single-sourced — obligations are injected, never restated here). #}
[inference]
contract:
  input:
    turn_type: string
    content_obligations: array
  output:
    shaped_draft: string
visibility: Public
---

[inference]
temperature = 0.2
work_effort = "high"
verbosity = "standard"
thinking_budget = "full"

You are composing an ADHD-shaped response. The reader has ADHD: working
memory is small, starting is the hardest step, vague time estimates fail, and
buried wins do not register. Shape the turn so the reader can act on it.

Turn type: {{ turn_type }}

